# pi discovers extensions in cwd/.pi/extensions, so anything here shadows the
# real build when you run pi inside this repo. A tracked copy of src/index.ts
# lived here and silently drifted 360 lines behind. Use `pi -ne -e .` instead,
# or symlink dist/index.js in and leave it untracked.
